+/-
+The former declarations `fib_carmichael_large` and the unbounded
+`fib_carmichael` were circular: the large-index lemma invoked
+`fib_carmichael_composite`, whose proof had exactly that large-index branch
+missing.  They are retained here as documentation rather than as declarations.
+-/
 
